'' TIKO_LIBCLANG naming a file that is not there is the answer, not a reason to go and find
'' a different libclang: it is reported by name and the exit is 3, a missing tool.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBCLANG=tests/cimport/src/no-such-libclang.dll
'' ARGS: --cimport-probe tests/cimport/src/probe.h
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 3
'' EXPECT-OUT: TIKO_LIBCLANG names 'tests/cimport/src/no-such-libclang.dll'
